      en: ["Municipal rights were granted to Helmond in 1232", "Helmond Castle was constructed around the year 1325", "The textile company Vlisco was established here in 1846", "The city covers an area of approximately 54 square kilometers", "The Cube Houses were designed and built in the 1970s", "The Zuid-Willemsvaart canal runs through the city"],
