      en: ["Tiel was officially granted city rights between 1200 and 1202.", "During the 10th and 11th centuries, it was a major minting center for coins.", "Fruit cultivation in the surrounding area covers over 10,000 hectares.", "The statue of the mascot Flipje is located in the central marketplace.", "The Sint-Maartenskerk tower is built in the specific Campine Gothic style.", "The city suffered extensive damage from shelling during late 1944."],
