      en: ["Granted city rights as early as 1375.", "Almost completely destroyed by a severe tornado in 1925.", "Home to the National Fire Brigade Museum of the Netherlands.", "Location of the Crystal Museum with a significant gemstone collection.", "The historic watermill 'De Mallumsche Molen' is located nearby.", "The river Berkel was historically used extensively for commercial transport."],
